@startuml analysis

title Analysis Layer (Phase 5 complete)

note as Dep
  No external dependency for subprocess.
  Platform abstraction: Process class
  - POSIX: fork/exec + pipe + select
  - Windows: CreateProcess + CreatePipe + PeekNamedPipe
  Stockfish communicates via UCI over stdin/stdout.
end note

class Process {
    -- POSIX fields --
    - pid : pid_t
    - stdinWrite : int
    - stdoutRead : int
    -- Windows fields --
    - hProcess : HANDLE
    - hStdinWrite : HANDLE
    - hStdoutRead : HANDLE
    -- shared --
    - readBuf : string
    + Process()
    + ~Process()
    + start(executable : string) : bool
    + writeLine(line : string) : bool
    + readLine(out : string&, timeoutMs : int) : bool
    + terminate() : void
    + isRunning() : bool
}

class UCIEngine {
    - process : Process
    - connected : bool
    - sendCommand(cmd : string) : bool
    - waitFor(prefix : string, lineOut : string*, timeoutMs : int) : bool
    + UCIEngine()
    + ~UCIEngine()
    + connect(enginePath : string) : bool
    + setPosition(fen : string) : void
    + analyze(depth : int) : EngineResult
    + shutdown() : void
    + isConnected() : bool
}

struct EngineResult {
    + bestMove : string
    + ponderMove : string
    + score : float
    + depth : int
    + pvLine : vector<string>
    + EngineResult()
}

class Statistics {
    - db : Database&
    - engine : UCIEngine&
    + Statistics(db : Database&, engine : UCIEngine&)
    + analyzeGame(gameId : int, depth : int) : int
    + detectBlunders(gameId : int, mistakeThreshold : float, blunderThreshold : float) : vector<BlunderInfo>
    + getOpeningStats(eco : string) : OpeningStats
    + getPositionFrequency(fen : string) : int
    + getPerformanceTrend(player : string, dateFrom : string, dateTo : string) : vector<TrendPoint>
}

struct BlunderInfo {
    + moveNum : int
    + san : string
    + evalBefore : float
    + evalAfter : float
    + drop : float
    + severity : string
}

struct OpeningStats {
    + eco : string
    + name : string
    + gamesPlayed : int
    + wins : int
    + draws : int
    + losses : int
    + winRate : float
    + OpeningStats()
}

struct TrendPoint {
    + date : string
    + gamesPlayed : int
    + winRate : float
    + blunderRate : float
    + TrendPoint()
}

class Database {
}

UCIEngine o-- Process       : owns
UCIEngine ..> EngineResult  : produces
Statistics o-- Database     : ref
Statistics o-- UCIEngine    : ref
Statistics ..> BlunderInfo  : produces
Statistics ..> OpeningStats : produces
Statistics ..> TrendPoint   : produces

note right of UCIEngine
  UCI protocol flow:
  1. process.start(stockfishPath)
  2. send "uci"    → waitFor("uciok")
  3. send "isready" → waitFor("readyok")
  4. send "position fen <fen>"
  5. send "go depth <N>"
  6. parse "info depth N score cp N pv ..." lines
  7. wait for "bestmove <move> [ponder <move>]"
  8. send "quit" on shutdown

  Score parsing:
  - "score cp N" → N/100 pawns
  - "score mate N" → ±999 sentinel
end note

note right of Statistics
  analyzeGame(): replays main line from DB
  via temp PGN file, evaluates each position,
  stores result via Database::saveAnalysis()

  detectBlunders(): reads stored evals via
  Database::getEvals(), computes per-move drop
  from side-to-move perspective.
  > 0.5 pawns drop = mistake
  > 2.0 pawns drop = blunder

  getPerformanceTrend(): buckets games by
  YYYY.MM, computes win rate per month
end note

@enduml
